 cookies, but some parts of the site will not then work.\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"ot-hlst-cntr\">\u003Cbutton class=\"ot-link-btn category-host-list-handler\" aria-label=\"Cookie Details button opens Cookie List menu\" data-parent-id=\"C0001\">Cookies Details‎\u003C/button>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ot-accordion-layout ot-cat-item ot-vs-config\" data-optanongroupid=\"C0002\">\u003Cbutton aria-expanded=\"false\" ot-accordion=\"true\" aria-controls=\"ot-desc-id-C0002\" aria-labelledby=\"ot-header-id-C0002\">\u003C/button>\u003C!-- Accordion header -->\u003Cdiv class=\"ot-acc-hdr\">\u003Ch4 class=\"ot-cat-header\" id=\"ot-header-id-C0002\">Performance Cookies\u003C/h4>\u003Cdiv class=\"ot-tgl\">\u003Cinput type=\"checkbox\" name=\"ot-group-id-C0002\" id=\"ot-group-id-C0002\" role=\"switch\" class=\"category-switch-handler\" data-optanongroupid=\"C0002\" aria-labelledby=\"ot-header-id-C0002\"> \u003Clabel class=\"ot-switch\" for=\"ot-group-id-C0002\">\u003Cspan class=\"ot-switch-nob\">\u003C/span> \u003Cspan class=\"ot-label-txt\">Performance Cookies\u003C/span>\u003C/label> \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ot-arw-cntr\">\u003Csvg class=\"ot-arw\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"caret-right\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M166.9 264.5l-117.8 116c-4.7 4.7-12.3 4.7-17 0l-7.1-7.1c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.3 0-17L127.3 256 25.1 155.6c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.3 0-17l7.1-7.1c4.7-4.7 12.3-4.7 17 0l117.8 116c4.6 4.7 4.6 12.3-.1 17z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C!-- accordion detail -->\u003Cdiv class=\"ot-acc-grpcntr ot-acc-txt\">\u003Cp class=\"ot-acc-grpdesc ot-category-desc\" id=\"ot-desc-id-C0002\">These cookies allow us to count visits and traffic sources so we can measure and improve the performance of our site. They help us to know which pages are the most and least popular and see how visitors move around the site. All inform